step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Head to Nardah, south of fairy ring DLQ, and talk to Awusah the Mayor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the house to the north and talk to Ghaslor the Elder. Make sure to receive ballad.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the building north of the fountain and west of Ghaslor's house.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the north-west cupboard for a torn robe top and bottom. Click here to continue when searching or you must search it twice.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a needle and thread on the torn robes (make sure you grab both top and bottom) and equip them</str>
