line	<str>Enter the room and clear the water channel by attacking the target on the other side with Ranged or Magic (37 ranged required even if using Magic).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the north door and talk to one of the spirits.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to Nardah.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Awusah the Mayor.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Take the <col=800000>shoes</col> by his door and use a <col=800000>knife</col> on them whilst outside of the house to obtain <col=800000>sole</col>.</col>
